{#- The minimal header of the sign-in / sign-up pages (docs/features/navigation README §4.10; implementation plan NAV-08,
    decision 25): the logo (Home - the Hub for a signed-in player, the homepage for guests, D5) and the language switch -
    nothing else. No search field, no Menu, no bars (_auth_layout.html.twig empties nav_chrome and nav_layers): a sign-in
    page holds no text input but its own form's, or iOS Password AutoFill offers the saved login over the one-time code
    (/verify-code, SignInCodeTest).
    The language links are language_switch_urls() (decision 36) through the shared _language_menu.html.twig: on the
    locale-less auth pages (`_auth_page`) they keep ?return= and carry ?_locale=. A <details>, never a Bootstrap
    dropdown (plan §3.2: .dropdown-menu only in the avatar ▾) - it works before any script; details-dismiss closes it on
    Esc (focus back on its summary) and on a tap or click outside it, as the old dropdown did (NAV review F6).
    The same 52/64 px box as the top bar (.site-header, critical CSS), without its tools; web only (_auth_layout wraps it
    in is_web()). Guest HTML stays shared-cacheable: nothing depends on the visitor but the URL and the Home link. -#}
{%- set names = {en: 'English', de: 'Deutsch', cs: 'Čeština', fr: 'Français', es: 'Español', ja: '日本語'} -%}
{%- set current_language = names[app.request.locale] ?? app.request.locale|upper -%}
<header class="site-header site-header--auth"{% if logged_user.profile is not null %} data-viewer-signed-in{% endif %}>
    <div class="site-header-inner">
        <a class="site-header-logo" href="{{ logged_user.profile is not null ? path('hub') : path('homepage') }}" data-nav="topbar/home/logo" aria-label="{{ 'nav.bar.home_logo'|trans }}">
            <img src="{{ asset('img/speedpuzzling-logo.svg') }}" width="36" height="32" alt="">
            <span class="site-header-brand" aria-hidden="true">MySpeedPuzzling</span>
        </a>
        <details class="site-header-language" data-controller="details-dismiss">
            {#- -#}<summary aria-label="{{ 'nav.account.language'|trans }}: {{ current_language }}">
                <svg class="nav-i" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4.545 6.714 4.11 8H3l1.862-5h1.284L8 8H6.833l-.435-1.286zm1.634-.736L5.5 3.956h-.049l-.679 2.022z"/><path d="M0 2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h7a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2zm2-1a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1zm7.138 9.995q.289.451.63.846c-.748.575-1.673 1.001-2.768 1.292.178.217.451.635.555.867 1.125-.359 2.08-.844 2.886-1.494.777.665 1.739 1.165 2.93 1.472.133-.254.414-.673.629-.89-1.125-.253-2.057-.694-2.82-1.284.681-.747 1.222-1.651 1.621-2.757H14V8h-3v1.047h.765c-.318.844-.74 1.546-1.272 2.13a6 6 0 0 1-.415-.492 2 2 0 0 1-.94.31"/></svg>
                <span class="site-header-language-name" lang="{{ app.request.locale }}">{{ current_language }}</span>
            {#- -#}</summary>
            {{- include('_language_menu.html.twig', {nav_surface: 'topbar', list_class: 'site-header-languages'}, with_context = false) -}}
        {#- -#}</details>
    </div>
</header>
